{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go camping with other players and setup a cozy campfire. Chat and make friends as you relax by the campfire, customize your campsite, forage in the forest, and cook up different foods in this cute hangout game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOK AT THE CAMPFIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fry, flip, stew, and cook over <strong>50+</strong> different recipes to complete your recipe book. Cook anything from a shoe to steak and if you're feeling hungry have a bite.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/eca1e71d17994da4cd4e414de82a5222.poster.avif?t=1772736041\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/eca1e71d17994da4cd4e414de82a5222.webm?t=1772736041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/eca1e71d17994da4cd4e414de82a5222.mp4?t=1772736041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GATHER INGREDIENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the campgrounds to find different ingredients to spice up your cooking. Add suspicious mushrooms or even socks to your stew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/bbf0a5d305f587ddb7cf5cad6627d6ef.poster.avif?t=1772736041\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/bbf0a5d305f587ddb7cf5cad6627d6ef.webm?t=1772736041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/bbf0a5d305f587ddb7cf5cad6627d6ef.mp4?t=1772736041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAMP WITH YOUR FRIENDs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a lobby or set up camp with friends and and chill. Tell stories, make jokes, or just sit in silence as you roast your marshmallows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/bf6a8d6588fafa33688b401a1028a37f.poster.avif?t=1772736041\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/bf6a8d6588fafa33688b401a1028a37f.webm?t=1772736041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/bf6a8d6588fafa33688b401a1028a37f.mp4?t=1772736041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRESS UP YOUR CAMPERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your outfit and customize your shirt, hat, and facewear. Everyone knows this is the most important part of any game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/ca9128e28177a32bb7351899703da1d3.poster.avif?t=1772736041\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/ca9128e28177a32bb7351899703da1d3.webm?t=1772736041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/ca9128e28177a32bb7351899703da1d3.mp4?t=1772736041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camping activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking and eating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer campfire hangouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public and private lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4085430?t=1772736041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4085430?t=1772736041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/1838bb0081cd12df084840a1d9eec89b07c7963d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772736041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/1838bb0081cd12df084840a1d9eec89b07c7963d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772736041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go camping with other players and setup a cozy campfire. Chat and make friends as you relax by the campfire, customize your campsite, forage in the forest, and cook up different foods in this cute hangout game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOK AT THE CAMPFIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fry, flip, stew, and cook over <strong>50+</strong> different recipes to complete your recipe book. Cook anything from a shoe to steak and if you're feeling hungry have a bite.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/eca1e71d17994da4cd4e414de82a5222.poster.avif?t=1772736041\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/extras/eca1e71d17994da4cd4e414de82a5222.webm?t=1772736041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085430/e